'),(5049504,5049505,0,1074,0,'stc(19,5) = 2 1'),(5049505,5049506,0,101,0,'Wow, Celestial Wine! You are such a kind and generous person! I am very pleased and will help you to promote your level with'),(5049506,5049507,0,101,0,'~the power of Dragonballs! Please remember, with great power, comes great responsibility!'),(5049507,5049508,0,101,0,''),(5049508,610067,0,102,0,'Amazing!~Thank~you. 5045000'),(5049510,5049511,0,101,0,'Hey, ever see that Shopboy in Twin City? He sells the famous Celestial Wine! It`s made with a secret recipe rumored to be'),(5049511,5049512,0,101,0,'~over a thousand years old! I`d do anything to get my hands on some! Anything!'),(5049512,5049513,0,101,0,''),(5049513,610067,0,102,0,'I`ll~see~what~I~can~do. 0'),(5049520,5049650,5049540,1073,0,'stc(19,6) == 2'),(5049650,5049651,0,101,0,'Why~are~you~still~standing~here?~I~thought~you~had~gone~to~buy~DrunkCelestial~for~me.'),(5049651,5049652,0,101,0,''),(5049652,5049653,0,101,0,''),(5049653,5049654,0,102,0,'Just~wait~a~while.~I~will~bring~wine. 5049530'),(5049654,610067,0,102,0,'Don`t~waste~my~time. 0'),(5049530,0,0,1074,0,'stc(19,5) = 1 1'),(5049540,5049541,0,101,0,'Hey, you there! Please take pity on a homeless old man! I am so hungry but can`t even afford a bowl of noodles. Could you help'),(5049541,5049542,0,101,0,'~me out here? The gods always smile on kindness, you know!'),(5049542,5049543,0,101,0,''),(5049543,5049544,0,102,0,'Here~are~100~silvers.~Take~care. 5049550'),(5049544,610067,0,102,0,'No~way.~I~don`t~do~charity. 0'),(5049550,5049551,5049552,1001,0,'money < 100'),(5049551,5049554,0,101,0,'It seems you are poorer than me...'),(5049554,610067,0,102,0,'Wait,~I~will~take~the~money. 0'),(5049552,5049553,0,1001,0,'money += -100'),(5049553,5049521,0,1074,0,'stc(19,6) = 2 1'),(5049521,5049522,0,101,0,'Wow, 100 silvers doesn`t buy much these days, but your kind gesture is noted. Say, do you think that you could buy me some'),(5049522,5049523,0,101,0,'~Celestial Wine from the Shop Boy in Twin C