ove~to~the~gentle~woolly~bear~but~was~bitten~all~around,~only~to~see~him~flying~away~with~a~beautiful~butterfly.'),(7538314,7538315,0,101,0,' However,~on~that~happy~day,~you~came~to~me,~and~came~into~my~life.~You~aroused~deep~love~in~my~heart,~but~left'),(7538315,7538316,0,101,0,' soon~with~my~heart-piercing~emotion.~I~miss~you~so~much.~Days~and~nights,~I~dream~that~one~day,~you~walk~towards'),(7538316,7538317,0,101,0,' me,~waving~your~hand,~with~attracting~smile~while~I~walk~towards~you~with~my~arms~wide~opened,~then~we~hug'),(7538317,7538318,0,101,0,' together,~tightly,~and~happily.~It~is~only~a~daydream,~I~know~you~will~not~come~back.'),(7538318,0,0,120,0,''),(7538330,7538331,0,101,0,'Love~is~a~hard~pursuit.~You~run~after~me~behind,~while~I~escape~ahead.~Different~person~has~different~feeling,'),(7538331,7538332,0,101,0,' different~comfort~varying~from~person~to~person.~People~court~me~for~abstract~desire.~And~I~just~run~and~escape.'),(7538332,7538333,0,101,0,' Until~one~day~when~I~encountered~with~you.~I~know~I~will~not~wait~in~vain.~I~find~you~at~last,~my~love.~I~am'),(7538333,7538334,0,101,0,' so~excited~and~eager~to~walk~together~with~you~all~the~way~through~my~life.~I~am~satisfied~but~sorrow,~for~I'),(7538334,7538335,0,101,0,' choose~to~escape~from~my~deep~love.~I~could~not~stand~being~rejected~any~more.~I~am~so~coward~that~I~do~not'),(7538335,7538336,0,101,0,' dare~to~imagine~that~you,~my~lover,~will~cook~me~into~pumpkin~soup.~Nevertheless,~I~know~I~will~not~be~lonely'),(7538336,7538337,0,101,0,'~any~longer.~Because,~you~are~there.~My~heart~will~go~wherever~you~go.'),(7538337,0,0,120,0,''),(7538350,7538351,0,101,0,'Love~is~beautiful,~wonderful~and~sweet~feeling.~When~I~met~you~at~the~first~sight,~I~fell~in~love~with~you.~You~are~so'),(7538351,7538352,0,101,0,' conspicuous~and~attracting~in~crowds.~Your~beauty~and~your~elegance~choked~me.~My~heart~beat~fast.~I~can~not~move~my'),(7538352,7538353,0,101,0,' eyes~from~you.~Oh,~my~love,~who~brings~you~to~me?~You~are~my~angel~sent~by~God.~I~pray~with~your~sweet~words~in'),(7538353,7538354,0,101,0,' my~ear.~I~am~indulged~in~it~and~mad~at~it,~in~spite~of~my~knowledge~that~it~is~just~lying.~I~am~willing~to~give~all'),(7538354,7538355,0,101,0,' I~have~to~you,~my~whole~heart~and~all~my~love.~Do~you~know~my~heart~smiles~at~thinking~of~you,~like~a~blooming'),(7538355,7538356,0,101,0,' pumpkin~flower~Even~in~cold~days,~I~feel~like~a~warm~and~delighting~day~in~spring.~You~leave~cheerfully,~and'),(7538356,7538357,0,101,0,' satisfied~with~things~you~want~in~your~hand,~without~turning~back.~I~will~never~regret.~But~my~heart~is~broken.'),(7538357,7538358,0,101,0,' It~is~being~pierced~by~a~overwhelming~pain.'),(7538358,0,0,120,0,''),(7538380,7538381,0,502,720368,''),(7538381,7538382,7538384,121,0,'1 10'),(7538382,7538383,0,501,720362,''),(7538383,7546428,0,303,1002,'At last, %user_name gives love to Pumpkin.'),(7546428,7546429,0,303,1011,'At last, %user_name gives love to Pumpkin.'),(7546429,7546430,0,303,1020,'At last, %user_name gives love to Pumpkin.'),(7546430,7546431,0,303,1015,'At last, %user_name gives love to Pumpkin.'),(7546431,0,0,303,1000,'At last, %user_name gives love to Pumpkin.'),(7538384,7538385,0,513,0,'8043 0000 0031 60'),(7538385,7546416,0,303,1002,'%user_name was turned into a Roaring Ape after eating Naughty Pumpkin.'),(7546416,7546417,0,303,1011,'%user_name was turned into a Roaring Ape after eating Naughty Pumpkin.'),(7546417,7546418,0,303,1020,'%user_name was turned into a Roaring Ape after eating Naughty Pumpkin.'),(7546418,7546419,0,303,1015,'%user_name was turned into a Roaring Ape after eating Naughty Pumpkin.'),(7546419,0,0,303,1000,'%user_name was turned into a Roaring Ape after eating Naughty Pumpkin.'),(7538490,7538491,7538499,508,5,''),(7538491,7538492,0,502,720369,''),(7538492,7546202,7538494,121,0,'1 200'),(7546202,7546203,0,501,137070,''),(7546203,7546432,0,303,1002,'Congratulations! %user_name has got a Dark Robe!'),(7546432,7546433,0,303,1011,'Congrat