~were~advised~to~find~the~Ruan~Brother~in~the~Hut,~in~the~north~of~Bird~Island.'),(9567301,9567302,0,1056,522,'new'),(9567270,9567271,0,101,0,'How is my Treasure House? So luxurious, right? It used to have countless treasure and collections, including the Tower Splinter.'),(9567271,9567272,0,101,0,''),(9567272,9567273,0,102,0,'Where~is~the~Tower~Splinter? 9567275'),(9567273,610064,0,102,0,'Not~bad. 0'),(9567275,9567276,0,101,0,'You knew that, didn`t you? The Tower Splinter was stolen by those bandits! And you`ve promised to investigate that for me, right?'),(9567276,610064,0,102,0,'Sure.~I`ll. 9567280'),(9567280,9567281,0,1057,521,'complete set 1'),(9567281,9567282,0,1001,1,'money += 100'),(9567282,9567283,0,1085,0,'gmlog/fangyufabao %user_name[%account_id,%user_id],Equipment~Bonus,Defense~Talisman,II,100~silvers'),(9567283,9567295,0,1010,2005,'You received 100 Silver!'),(9567240,9567241,0,101,0,'Years ago, the defensive talisman, Star Tower, was broken into three pieces. For that, our Yang family and the Tang family became enemies.'),(9567241,9567242,0,101,0,'~If I can find all the Tower Splinters, maybe I can end the feud between the two clans. What`s your opinion?'),(9567242,9567243,0,102,0,'I~heard~you~have~one~piece. 9567250'),(9567243,610064,0,102,0,'Could~be. 0'),(9567250,9567251,0,101,0,'Um... Yeah, I have one of the pieces. How did you know? You must have pulled quite a few strings to hear'),(9567251,9567252,0,101,0,'~about that. Well, I guess I`d better tell you where the piece is, before you wreck the place. It`s in the Treasure House.'),(9567252,9567253,0,102,0,'I`m~doing~this~for~Sugar~Tang. 9567255'),(9567253,610064,0,102,0,'I`m~just~passing~by. 0'),(9567255,9567256,0,101,0,'Sugar Tang? So you are trying to end the feud, right? In that case, I`ll take you to the House myself! Thank you for your help.'),(9567256,610064,0,102,0,'Just~doing~my~job. 9567260'),(9567260,9567261,0,1003,0,'1782 52 50'),(9567261,9567262,0,1057,520,'data1 set 1'),(9567262,0,0,10