ournament starts. After you sign up, please wait in the waiting area for the tournament to begin.'),(90022021,90022022,0,101,0,'~When the match starts, four groups will compete one by one, from level 130+ Group to level 1-99 Group, at an interval of 2 minutes. During the tournament, if you quit your team, you will forfeit'),(90022022,90022023,0,101,0,'~the match. The teams created during the tournament can`t participate in the matches. During the Knockout, each match shall end within 10 minutes.'),(90022023,90022024,0,101,0,''),(90022024,610040,0,102,0,'I~see,~no~new~teams. 90022030'),(90022030,90022031,0,101,0,'Yeah, and when there are less than 8 teams left in the field, the Final begins. Each round of the Final lasts for 15 minutes. Though all of the Top 8 players will receive nice prizes, the top 3 will earn better prizes than the others!'),(90022031,90022032,0,101,0,'~Only the team leaders can claim the rewards. You should claim them before next week\'s tournament starts, or you`ll lose your prizes.'),(90022032,90022033,0,101,0,''),(90022033,90022034,0,102,0,'Great!~Sign~me~up! 90022040'),(90022034,610040,0,102,0,'Hm,~I`ll~go~get~some~friends! 0'),(90022285,90022286,0,101,0,'The Team PK Tournament starts at 19:00 today. Please create or join a team, or you`ll be sent out of the field'),(90022286,90022287,0,101,0,'~when the Tournament starts! When the Tournament ends, only the leaders of the winning teams can claim the reward.'),(90022287,90022003,0,101,0,'From Dec. 22 to Jan. 21, Warrior champions will receive extra rewards.'),(90022290,90022001,0,101,0,'Attention! The Team PK Tournament will be held every Saturday. The Top 8 teams will be handsomely rewarded, and each player in the tournament can receive EXP and 1,000 Honor Points after each match.'),(90022001,90022002,0,101,0,'Every participant will receive 1 EXP Ball and 1000 Honor Points from each tournament. From Dec. 22 to Jan. 21, the Taoist Team Leader of the winning team will receive extra rewards.'),(