points for each match you take part in at the end of that match!'),(90016523,90016524,0,101,0,''),(90016524,90016525,0,101,0,''),(90016525,90016526,0,102,0,'Sign~me~up! 90016530'),(90016526,610026,0,102,0,'Not~interested. 0'),(90017350,90017335,90017330,1001,0,'level < 100'),(90017335,90017351,0,101,0,'Elite PK Tournament begins at 20:06. Please stay in the Waiting Area, or you`ll lose the right to compete!'),(90017351,90017352,0,101,0,'~Each round in the Knockout lasts for 3 minutes. If more than one is left at the end, the contestant with a higher score wins. When all rounds of the Knockout have ended, the Final begins.'),(90017352,90017353,0,102,0,'I~want~to~leave~here. 90017360'),(90017353,90017355,0,102,0,'I~want~to~buy~some~potions. 90017370'),(90017355,90017354,0,102,0,'What~prizes~are~you~giving? 90017375'),(90017354,610040,0,102,0,'I`ll~think~about~it. 0'),(90017375,90017376,0,101,0,'You`ll receive EXP worth 1 EXP Ball and 1000 Honor Points at the end of each round, and the Top 8 players will receive better prizes. To claim these prizes, find the Elite PK Envoy before next week`s Elite PK Tournament begins, or you won`t get them.'),(90017376,90017377,0,101,0,''),(90017377,90017378,0,101,0,''),(90017378,610040,0,102,0,'Got~it. 0'),(90017370,0,0,1511,0,''),(90017360,90017410,90017420,123,3,'5 20:00 5 22:00'),(90017410,90017411,0,101,0,'Are you sure you want to leave here? The tournament has begun and you won`t be able to join it, if you leave now.'),(90017411,90017412,0,102,0,'Just~let~me~go! 90017420'),(90017412,610040,0,102,0,'I`ll~think~about~it. 0'),(90017420,90017425,0,1004,0,'1002 410 354'),(90017425,90017364,90017362,121,0,'1 4'),(90017364,90017368,0,1509,0,'1002 410 354 5 5'),(90017368,90017361,0,1075,0,'send 1000 0'),(90017361,90016570,0,105,0,'You~arrived~in~Twin~City.'),(90017362,90017365,90017363,121,0,'1 3'),(90017365,90017368,0,1509,0,'1002 410 354 5 5'),(90017363,90017366,90017367,121,0,'1 2'),(90017366,90017368,0,1509,0,'1002 410 354 5 5'),(90017367,90017368,0,1509,0,'1002 410 354 5 5'),(90017330,90017336,90017331,1001,0,'level < 120'),(90017336,90017351,0,101,0,'Elite PK Tournament begins at 20:04. Please stay in the Waiting Area, or you`ll lose the right to compete!'),(90017331,90017337,90017332,1001,0,'level < 130'),(90017337,90017351,0,101,0,'Elite PK Tournament begins at 20:02. Please stay in the Waiting Area, or you`ll lose the right to compete!'),(90017332,90017338,0,1001,0,'level < 141'),(90017338,90017351,0,101,0,'Elite PK Tournament begins at 20:00. Please stay in the Waiting Area, or you`ll lose the right to compete!'),(97000000,97000001,97000003,150,36,'3 data == 1'),(97000001,97000002,0,101,0,'Ladies and gentlemen, the `Treasure In The Blue` has started! No matter you are male or female, old or young, if you have interested in treasure hunting or pirates and have reached,'),(97000002,97000006,0,101,0,'~Level 80, sign up with me for a sea adventure! Rewards? Of course!'),(97000006,97000007,0,102,0,'Send~me~to~the~Proud~Sea! 97000010'),(97000007,97000008,0,102,0,'Treasure~hunting? 97000050'),(97000008,97000009,0,102,0,'What~are~the~rewards? 97000110'),(97000009,610011,0,102,0,'I`ll~think~it~over. 0'),(97000110,97000111,0,101,0,'Trust me, you will be more than satisfied with the rewards. I can take some examples. When you exchange the Gold Coin with Mammon Envoy in the Prize Center, you`ll receive a Small'),(97000111,97000112,0,101,0,'~Lottery Ticket and have a chance to get a rare mount armor. For the Silver Coin, you can get an Endurance Book and a small gift. When you exchange the Copper Coin, you`ll receive a'),(97000112,97000113,0,101,0,'~mysterious gift. Interested? You`d better be quick, since the rewards are limited.'),(97000113,610011,0,102,0,'What~do~you~mean~limited? 97000120'),(97000120,97000121,0,101,0,'Eh... You know we are a small team with limited human resources, so we accept Gold Coins exchange 100 times at most; Silver Coins exchange 200 times at most and Copper Coins exchange'),(97000121,97000122,0,101,0,'~400 times at most. When all the rewards are taken or it is 1 hour after the event time, we won`t accept any exchange. Hope you get what you like!'),(97000122,97000124,0,101,0,''),(97000124,610011,0,102,0,'I~know,~time~is~money. 0'),(97000050,97000051,0,101,0,'Our ship will send treasure hunters to the Proud Sea at 12:30-13:29 and 20:30-21:29, Monday - Saturday. If you have reached Level 80, I`d be glad to count you in. Join our `Treasure In The Blue` adventure!'),(97000051,97000052,0,101,0,''),(97000052,97000053,0,101,0,''),(97000053,610011,0,102,0,'What?~`Treasure~In~The~Blue`? 97000060'),(97000060,97000061,0,101,0,'Alas... That`s what I want, but you came too late and all the gifts have been claimed. So, come earlier in the next hour!'),(97000061,97000062,0,101,0,''),(97000062,97000063,0,101,0,''),(97000063,610011,0,102,0,'What~are~the~treasures? 97000070'),(97000070,97000071,0,101,0,'Stop kidding me! You don`t bring any Gold Coins with you. Do I look like a fool?'),(97000071,97000072,0,101,0,''),(97000072,97000073,0,101,0,''),(97000073,610011,0,102,0,'Special~sea~monsters? 97000080'),(97000080,97000081,0,101,0,'Really? You have the Silver Coin? If you give it to me, you`ll receive an Endurance Book. Not enough? How about adding a Weapon Accessory Pack or a Mount Armor?'),(97000081,97000082,0,101,0,'~So, what do you say? Deal?'),(97000082,97000083,0,101,0,''),(97000083,610011,0,102,0,'I`ll~think~it~over. 97000090'),(97000090,97000091,0,101,0,'Mammon Envoy is in the Prize Center and he is my partner. You can find any one of the 8 PC Teleporters in the Proud Sea to send you there.'),(97000091,97000092,0,101,0,'~If you just returned from the Prize Center, you need to wait 3 minutes to go there again. Did I miss anything?'),(97000092,97000093,0,101,0,''),(97000093,610011,0,102,0,'Any~tips? 97000100'),(97000100,97000101,0,101,0,'Let me see... Yeah, I mentioned that you can get coins from other treasure hunters. Whereas, you may be the target of others, too. Though no PK point will be counted in the Proud Sea,'),(97000101,97000102,0,101,0,'~the items in your inventory may drop, including the coins, if you were killed. Take care!'),(97000102,97000103,0,101,0,''),(97000103,610011,0,102,0,'Sure,~I~will. 0'),(97000010,97000011,0,101,0,'It seems you have made up the mind. Wait, have you put away all the valuables? You know, the Proud Sea is so dangerous that you wouldn`t know what strong enemies you may meet. So, I suggest you recheck your inventory.'),(97000011,97000012,0,102,0,'Don`t~worry.~I`m~ready. 97000015'),(97000012,610011,0,102,0,'I`ll~be~back~soon. 0'),(97000015,97000017,97000020,150,36,'3 data == 1'),(97000017,97000030,97000040,1001,0,'level < 80'),(97000030,97000031,0,101,0,'Um... You are still too young. Keep practicing, and come back when you reach Level 80.'),(97000031,97000033,0,101,0,''),(97000033,610011,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(97000040,0,0,122,0,'97000041 97000046 97000042 97000047 97000043 97000048 97000044 97000049'),(97000041,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 251 392 1'),(97000045,97151089,0,1085,0,'gmlog/haidaoyibao %user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],the~number~of~participants'),(97000046,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 348 208 1'),(97000042,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 72 131 1'),(97000047,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 348 208 1'),(97000043,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 197 64 1'),(97000048,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 348 208 1'),(97000044,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 348 208 1'),(97000049,97000045,0,1003,0,'3071 348 208 1'),(97000020,97000021,0,101,0,'Wow, I didn`t expect you would make a decision so fast, but the ship has been at sea. Why not come earlier next time? Remember the ship will put to sea at 12:30-13:29 and 20:30-21:29 every day.'),(97000021,97000022,0,101,0,'~Hope to see you next time.'),(97000022,610011,0,102,0,'See~you. 0'),(97000003,97000004,0,101,0,'Hey! Have you ever heard the Proud Sea? Yeah, I mean the place where lots of pirates` ships sank and treasures lost. Well, our ship will be at sea at 12:30-13:29 and 20:30-21:29, Monday - Saturday.'),(97000004,97000005,0,101,0,'~Want to join us to hunt treasures? I promise that will be an unforgettable adventure. Moreover, you can win great rewards, if you find us the treasures. I await your decision!'),(97000005,97000007,0,101,0,''),(94067320,94398795,0,101,0,'Queen of Evil has led a devil army to invade the Dragon Island, aiming to reactivate the Twisting Hell Array.  Go break the devil invasion to win EXP boost, Realm Quest Token and Daily Quest Token.'),(94384690,94384691,94398795,123,0,'2014-10-21 00:00 2014-11-30 23:59'),(94384691,94398796,0,101,0,'(During Dragon-Warrior Privilege Month from Oct. 30th to Nov. 30th, the Chi Token will bring Dragon-Warrior 360 minutes of EXP and 200 Chi Points.)'),(94398796,94398797,0,101,0,'From Dec. 8th to Dec. 21st, you can smelt the Gold Cloth fragments into Saint Crystals, which can be used to swap for Gold Cloth and King of Scorpions from Girl of Wisdom in Twin City (229,224).'),(94398797,0,0,122,0,'94067330 94067330 94067330 94067330 94067330 94067330 94067330 94067330'),(94067330,94067334,94067332,1056,6329,'isexit'),(94067334,94067331,94067332,1057,6329,'complete == 1'),(94067331,94067332,94067333,1057,6329,'data6 == 0'),(94067332,97004300,0,102,0,'Open~Treasure~Chest~(Level~50). 94067460'),(97004300,97004301,97004303,1056,6245,'isexit'),(97004301,97004302,98021710,1057,6245,'complete == 1'),(97004302,97004303,97004315,1057,6245,'data6 == 0'),(97004303,94067324,0,102,0,'Everything~Has~A~Price~[L60]. 97002210'),(94067335,94067328,94067337,1056,6049,'isexit'),(94067328,94067336,94067337,1057,6049,'complete == 2'),(94067336,94067337,94067338,1057,6049,'data6 == 0'),(94067337,97022500,0,102,0,'Fellow~Fighters~[L70]. 94067470'),(97022500,97022501,97022503,1056,6366,'isexit'),(97022501,97022502,97022510,1057,6366,'complete == 1'),(97022502,97022503,97022505,1057,6366,'data6 == 0'),(97022503,94067324,0,102,0,'Rare~Materials.~(Lv.75) 97023550'),(94067324,94067326,94067325,1081