est days only come when I`m with you.'),(98060045,98060055,98060046,121,0,'1 3'),(98060055,98060060,0,125,2007,'%s wants to thank his/her love: When I met you, my dreams changed. Now my only aim is to be with you.'),(98060046,98060056,98060057,121,0,'1 2'),(98060056,98060060,0,125,2007,'%s wants to thank his/her love: Loving you is the best thing I`ve ever done. You brought me peace and laughter.'),(98060057,98060060,0,125,2007,'%s wants to thank his/her love: They say people only fall in love once, but that can`t be true, because every time I look at you I fall in love all over again.'),(98060080,98060081,0,1073,0,'stc(109,23) >= 5'),(98060081,98060082,0,1074,0,'stc(109,23) = 0 1'),(98060082,98060083,0,1001,0,'level < 140'),(98060083,98060084,0,1061,0,'var(5) set 0'),(98060084,98060085,0,1086,0,'1200 5'),(98060085,98060086,98060086,1001,0,'exp += %iter_var_data5 nocontribute'),(98060086,98060087,0,1061,0,'var(5) set 0'),(98060087,98060088,0,105,0,'Congratulations!~You`ve~received~EXP~worth~2~EXP~Balls!'),(98060088,98060089,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 350,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10001149,2,4,120'),(98060089,0,0,1085,0,'gmlog/emoney_buy %user_id	%user_name	%account_id	999	2134	0	'),(98060001,98060002,0,498,0,''),(98060002,98060003,0,1027,0,'self zf2-e232 add'),(98060003,0,0,105,0,'Thanksgiving~Day~has~passed~and~this~Purple~Wishing~Card~is~of~no~use.'),(98060100,98060110,98060101,123,0,'2012-11-23 00:00 2012-11-28 23:59'),(98060110,98060111,98060115,1001,0,'level < 80'),(98060111,0,0,105,0,'You~have~to~reach~Level~80~to~use~this~Red~Wishing~Card!'),(98060115,98060120,0,498,0,''),(98060120,98060121,98060122,1073,0,'stc(109,19) >= 1'),(98060121,98060122,98060140,1081,0,'interval(109,19,1) >= 1'),(98060122,98060123,0,1074,0,'stc(109,19) = 1 1'),(98060123,98060130,0,1080,0,'timestamp(109,19) set 0'),(98060130,98060131,0,1074,0,'stc(109,23) += 1 1'),(98060131,98060132,0,122,0,'98060080 98060080 98060080 98060080 98060080 98060080 98060080 9806008