124125'),(4124114,4124115,0,102,0,'B.~Permanent~Stones. 4124120'),(4124115,4124116,0,102,0,'C.~CPs. 4124125'),(4124116,610091,0,102,0,'D.~I`ll~think~about~it. 0'),(4124120,4124121,0,1057,1028,'data1 += 1'),(4124085,4124090,0,1056,1028,'new'),(4124002,9171854,0,102,0,'Study~Artifact&Refinery~(1). 4124010'),(4124010,4124021,4124011,1056,1027,'isexit'),(4124021,4124022,0,101,0,'Artifacts are equipment that has been purified with Dragon Souls and Martial Souls, to improve the equipment`s attributes. After stabilization,'),(4124022,4124023,0,101,0,'~temporary artifacts become permanent artifacts. Dragon Souls and Martial Souls are not easy to come by. It will take some effort to acquire them.'),(4124023,4124024,0,101,0,''),(4124024,610091,0,102,0,'Oh?~What~should~I~do? 4124030'),(4124030,4124031,0,101,0,'Well, most of them were hoarded by powerful monsters, in the past. These beasts are scattered across the world, and usually carry Dragon/Martial'),(4124031,4124032,0,101,0,'~Souls with them. Take care of those creatures, and you can loot their purification materials! If you want Martial Souls, you should search for'),(4124032,4124033,0,101,0,'~the smaller bosses worldwide. The Terato Dragon and Lava Beast in the Frozen Grotto have Dragon Souls.'),(4124033,4124034,0,101,0,''),(4124034,610091,0,102,0,'How~to~use~the~Souls? 4124040'),(4124040,4124041,0,101,0,'Well, you can come to me when you have a Soul, and I`ll purify your equipment with them. But please keep in mind that the Dragon Souls and the'),(4124041,4124042,0,101,0,'~Martial Souls vary in type, and they can only purify equipment of the same type. Besides, it takes a few Meteors to purify your equipment. Make'),(4124042,4124043,0,101,0,'~sure you have enough of them to pay the fee. The Artifact effects are only temporary, and will return to its previous form after seven days.'),(4124043,4124044,0,101,0,'~If you are really enjoying their effects, you can also stabilize the effect and make it permanent!'),(4124044,4124045,0,101,0,''),(4124045,610091,0,102,0,'So~how~to~stabilize~it? 4124050'),(4124050,4124051,0,101,0,'You can stabilize the Purification effects with Permanent Stones. Different stabilization points are needed for a different phases of purification.'),(4124051,4124052,0,101,0,'~These stones are available in the Shopping Mall. Just bring the temporary Artifact and enough Permanent Stones, and I will help you stabilize it!'),(4124052,4124053,0,101,0,'~Yeah, that`s pretty much it. I`m just that good, haha.'),(4124053,4124054,0,101,0,''),(4124054,610091,0,102,0,'That`s~not~very~complicated. 4124060'),(4124060,4124061,0,101,0,'Sure, and they are extremely useful! You`ll like them, I guarantee it!'),(4124061,4124062,0,101,0,''),(4124062,610091,0,102,0,'You~bet! 4124070'),(4124070,4124071,0,1057,1027,'complete set 1'),(4124071,4124072,0,1061,0,'var(5) set 0'),(4124072,4124073,0,1086,0,'50 5'),(4124073,4124074,4124074,1001,0,'exp += %iter_var_data5 nocontribute'),(4124074,4124075,0,1061,0,'var(5) set 0'),(4124075,4124076,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 350,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000336,1,4,5'),(4124076,4124077,0,1027,0,'self angelwing'),(4124077,4124081,0,1010,2007,'You received 5 minutes worth of EXP.'),(4124011,4124012,0,101,0,'When it comes to Artifacts and Stabilization, no one knows more about it than me!'),(4124012,4124013,0,101,0,''),(4124013,4124014,0,102,0,'Really?~Impress~me. 4124020'),(4124014,610091,0,102,0,'Oh,~good~for~you! 0'),(4124020,4124021,0,1056,1027,'new'),(4124009,9171854,4124002,1001,0,'level < 30'),(9075900,9075901,0,101,0,'Hey there! I can channel the power of Permanent Stones and stabilize the Refinery, which means making the temporary Refinery permanent. Permanent Stones have 10 Stabilization Points,'),(9075901,9075902,0,101,0,'~and Big Permanent Stones have 100. Different Refinery levels require different amounts of points. I can only perform the stabilization with enough of them. Are we clear? Good.'),(9075902,4124160,