102,0,'I~see. 0'),(97030690,97030691,0,101,0,'If you want to leave the Jiang Hu for a while, deactivate the `Jiang` mode and wait for 10 minutes to quit.'),(97030691,97030692,0,101,0,'~After that, you won`t receive threats from the Jiang Hu fighters, however, you can`t accumulate Talent Points. Remember, you`re welcome to return at anytime you want!'),(97030692,97030663,0,101,0,''),(97030663,97030664,0,102,0,'Learn~about~other~things. 97030650'),(97030664,610074,0,102,0,'I~see. 0'),(97030680,97030681,0,101,0,'In Jiang Hu, you`ll find the 9 stages to explore. Each stage is comprised of 9 stars. When you activate a star by studying, you`ll receive one attribute of a random quality.'),(97030681,97030663,0,101,0,'~If you take matching attributes on adjacent stars, they`ll become aligned, enhancing the attribute. The more aligned stars, the better!'),(97030670,97030671,0,101,0,'Jiang Hu fighters will gain up to 100 Free Courses by accumulating the Talent Points over time, whether online or not. The higher the Talent Status,'),(97030671,97030672,0,101,0,'~the more the Talent Points. While stay online in Twin City, you`ll receive Talent Points, up to x30 more than received in other areas.'),(97030672,97030663,0,101,0,''),(97030660,97030661,0,101,0,'You need to activate the `Jiang` mode, and defeat a player whose Talent Status is not lower than yours to raise your Status Level by 1,'),(97030661,97030662,0,101,0,'~up to Level 4. PK in the `Jiang` mode, win or lose, will only affect your Talent Status. Different levels of your Status makes your name glow different colors.'),(97030662,97030663,0,101,0,''),(97030510,97030511,97030513,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 2'),(97030511,97030512,0,101,0,'Hey, you`re still too green! Keep practicing, and come to me when you reach Level 30 of your 2nd rebirth.'),(97030512,610074,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(97030513,97030511,97030514,1001,0,'level < 30'),(97030514,97030515,97030520,1706,0,''),(97030515,97030516,0,101,0,'Wait, you`ve already customized a skill in Jiang Hu. No need to take the test, again.'),(97030516,610074,0,102,0,'Okay. 0'),(97030520,97030521,0,101,0,'Pay attention! How can you PK in Jiang Hu?'),(97030521,97030522,0,102,0,'Activate~`Jiang`~in~the~Arena. 97030530'),(97030522,97030523,0,102,0,'Switch~the~PK~mode~to~`Jiang`. 97030535'),(97030523,97030524,0,102,0,'Activate~`Jiang`~in~the~clan. 97030530'),(97030524,610074,0,102,0,'Activate~`Jiang`~in~the~guild. 97030530'),(97030530,97030531,0,101,0,'What a pity! You gave a wrong answer. Don`t lose heart! You can try again.'),(97030531,610074,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(97030535,97030536,0,101,0,'Correct! After you being a Jiang Hu fighter, you`ll find the `Jiang` added to the PK modes. While in `Jiang` mode,'),(97030536,97030537,0,101,0,'~you can only attack fighters also on the path of Jiang Hu. Okay, next question!'),(97030537,610074,0,102,0,'Please! 97030540'),(97030540,97030541,0,101,0,'What will you get if defeating a fighter of Jiang Hu whose Talent Status is not lower than yours in the `Jiang` mode?'),(97030541,97030542,0,102,0,'EXP. 97030530'),(97030542,97030543,0,102,0,'Silver. 97030530'),(97030543,97030544,0,102,0,'My~Talent~Status~will~raise. 97030555'),(97030544,610074,0,102,0,'CPs. 97030530'),(97030555,97030556,0,101,0,'You got it! While in `Jiang` mode, if you defeat fighters whose Talent Status are not lower than yours, you`ll have your Talent Status raised, up to Level 4.'),(97030556,97030557,0,101,0,'~Different levels of your Status will make your name glow different colors. Well, next question!'),(97030557,610074,0,102,0,'Please! 97030560'),(97030560,97030561,0,101,0,'Except the Talent Status Level, will PK in the `Jiang` mode affect other things?'),(97030561,97030562,0,102,0,'No. 97030570'),(97030562,97030563,0,102,0,'Double~the~PK~Points. 97030530'),(97030563,97030564,0,102,0,'Lose~Study~Points. 97030530'),(97030564,610074,0,102,0,'Lose~extra~EXP. 97030530'),(97030570,97030571,0,101,0,'You`re right! While PK in the `Jiang` mode, win or lose, it`ll only affect your Talent Status. So, next question!'),(97030571,610074,0,102,0,'I`m~always~ready! 97030575'),(97030575,97030576,0,101,0,'After being a fighter of Jiang Hu, you can push the `Jiang` button, and train your Inner-strength on the `Jiang Hu` interface. But, where is the `Jiang` button?'),(97030576,97030578,0,102,0,'Ask~Mr.~Sage~to~open. 97030530'),(97030578,97030579,0,102,0,'On~character~window. 97030595'),(97030579,97030580,0,102,0,'In~Arena. 97030530'),(97030580,610074,0,102,0,'On~the~upper~screen. 97030530'),(97030595,97030596,0,101,0,'Correct! Each time you study will cost you 10 Study Points and 1 Free Course, and will also decrease your Talent Status by 1.'),(97030596,97030597,0,101,0,'~Remember, you can only perform up to 10 free studies in a day. Okay, next question!'),(97030597,610074,0,102,0,'Please! 97030700'),(97030700,97030701,0,101,0,'You know, you`ll gain Free Courses by accumulating Talent Points over time. The higher the Talent Status, the faster the accumulation.'),(97030701,97030702,0,101,0,'~Which one do you think is correct?'),(97030702,97030703,0,102,0,'It`s~x30~more~in~Twin~City. 97030530'),(97030703,97030704,0,102,0,'It~also~works~while~offline. 97030530'),(97030704,97030705,0,102,0,'Max~Free~Courses:~100. 97030530'),(97030705,610074,0,102,0,'The~3~above~are~all~correct. 97030710'),(97030710,97030711,0,101,0,'Bingo! Whether online or offline, you`ll gain the Free Courses, up to 100. If you stay online in Twin City, you`ll receive a greater number of Talent Points,'),(97030711,97030712,0,101,0,'~up to x30 more than received in other areas. Great, next question!'),(97030712,97030713,0,101,0,''),(97030713,610074,0,102,0,'I`m~ready! 97030715'),(97030715,97030716,0,101,0,'There are 15 types of inner-strength attributes. Each attribute has 6 different qualities as, from low to high, Common, Sharp, Pure, Rare, Ultra and Epic. Then, how to get an Epic attribute?'),(97030716,97030717,0,101,0,''),(97030717,97030718,0,102,0,'Study~with~the~Chaotic~Pill. 97030530'),(97030718,97030719,0,102,0,'Study~with~EXP. 97030530'),(97030719,97030720,0,102,0,'Study~an~Ultra~attribute. 97030725'),(97030720,610074,0,102,0,'Defeat~many~Jiang~Hu~fighters. 97030530'),(97030725,97030726,0,101,0,'Ah, you`re smart! If you receive an Ultra attribute, keep studying it and you`ll have the chance to go down the Chaotic Path,'),(97030726,97030727,0,101,0,'~and increase the attribute to the Epic, the most powerful level. Let`s go to the next question!'),(97030727,97030728,0,101,0,''),(97030728,610074,0,102,0,'Okay. 97030730'),(97030730,97030732,0,101,0,'We finally come to the last question. While studying, if you take matching attributes on adjacent stars, what will happen?'),(97030732,97030733,0,102,0,'It`ll~enhance~the~attributes. 97030740'),(97030733,97030734,0,102,0,'It`ll~improve~my~Battle~Power. 97030530'),(97030734,97030735,0,102,0,'I`ll~get~Free~Courses. 97030530'),(97030735,610074,0,102,0,'I`ll~be~luck~in~next~study. 97030530'),(97030740,97030741,0,101,0,'Excellent! While studying, if you take matching attributes on adjacent stars, the stars will be aligned and the attributes will be intensified. The more aligned stars, the better.'),(97030741,97030742,0,101,0,'~Hero, you`re qualified to name a unique skill of your own now!'),(97030742,610074,0,102,0,'Great! 97030620'),(97030620,97030511,97030624,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 2'),(97030624,97030511,97030621,1001,0,'level < 30'),(97030621,97030515,97030622,1706,0,''),(97030622,97030623,0,1027,0,'self zf2-e300'),(97030623,0,0,1046,617,''),(97298720,97298721,0,101,0,'<tip color=0xffffff00 desc=		She#felt#shame#at#being#born#in#a#notorious#poisonmaking#family.#To#minimize#her#sin,'),(97298721,90011000,0,101,0,'she#does#her#best#to#save#anyone#who#is#poisoned#by#her#family.>Apothecary</tip>:\n'),(90011000,90011001,0,101,0,'Hello there! Please allow me to introduce to you the sub-class of the Apothecary. An Apothecary is a master of various oriental herbs and can use their healing powers to protect themselves from poison damage.'),(90011001,90011002,0,101,0,'~Would you like to join us? After you join this sub-class, you can level it up and get promoted to gain more protection.'),(90011002,90011003,0,101,0,''),(90011003,90011004,0,101,0,''),(90011004,90011005,0,101,0,''),(90011005,90011006,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join! 90011010'),(90011006,90011007,0,102,0,'I~want~to~get~promoted. 90011110'),(90011007,90011008,0,102,0,'How~can~I~get~promoted? 90011500'),(90011008,610110,0,102,0,'Nice.~I`ll~think~about~it. 0'),(90011500,90011501,0,101,0,'Good day! Please spare me a few minutes so that I can tell you about the sub-classes in Twin City. Each Sub-Class has 9 phases, and the higher the phase is, the more bonus effects the sub-class will offer. But keep in mind that these'),(90011501,90011502,0,101,0,'~sub-classes also have a level system and you need to level them up before you can get promoted. You can level up your sub-class by gaining study points.'),(90011502,90011503,0,102,0,'How~can~I~get~study~points? 90011510'),(90011503,610110,0,102,0,'Oh.~Thanks~for~telling~me. 0'),(90011510,90011511,0,101,0,'Well, the only way to get those points is to read the sub-class books, such as the Diligence Book. When you`ve gained enough study points, open the sub-class sheet from the character panel and'),(90011511,90011512,0,101,0,'~level up the sub-class there. Monsters in the wild are always bothering young adventurers, so you might find some books from them.'),(90011512,90011513,0,101,0,''),(90011513,610110,0,102,0,'I~see. 0'),(90011110,90011120,90011130,1551,0,'5 < 1'),(90011120,90011121,0,101,0,'You are not an Apothecary yet and can`t get promoted. Do you want to join the Apothecary sub-class now?'),(90011121,90011122,0,101,0,''),(90011122,90011123,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join. 90011010'),(90011123,610110,0,102,0,'Oh.~Not~now. 0'),(90011010,90011011,0,101,0,'The Apothecaries are quite good at protecting themselves from poison damage. If you want to join us, you should have reached Level 70 and pay me 10 Meteors or 800 Study Points.'),(90011011,90011012,0,101,0,'~After that, you can start your sub-class training on the `Status` sheet. Remember, a certain sub-class level is required to promote the phase of your sub-class.'),(90011012,90011013,0,101,0,''),(90011013,90011014,0,101,0,''),(90011014,90118290,0,102,0,'Pay~10~Meteors~to~join. 90011020'),(90118290,90011015,0,102,0,'Pay~800~Study~Points~to~join. 90118360'),(90011015,610110,0,102,0,'Oh,~it~does~not~suit~me. 0'),(90118360,90118361,0,101,0,'    Are you sure you want to pay 800 Study Points to join us?'),(90118361,90118362,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`ve~decided! 90118291'),(90118362,610110,0,102,0,'No,~I~changed~my~mind. 0'),(90118291,90118292,90011021,1552,0,'5 < 1'),(90118292,90118293,90118294,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 1'),(90118293,90011032,90118294,1001,0,'level < 70'),(90011032,90011033,0,101,0,'You will be invited to join us after you reach level 70. Work harder!'),(90011033,90011034,0,101,0,''),(90011034,610110,0,102,0,'Oh. 0'),(90118294,90118297,90118295,1001,0,'cultivation < 800'),(90118297,90118298,0,101,0,'You don`t have 800 Study Points to take the sub-class.'),(90118298,610110,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(90118295,90118296,0,1001,0,'cultivation += -800'),(90118296,90011051,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 340,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000116,3,0,0'),(90011051,90011052,0,1550,0,'5'),(90011052,90011053,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 340,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000112,1,0,0'),(90011053,90011054,0,1027,0,'self zf2-e300 add'),(90011054,90011055,0,1010,2005,'%s is an Apothecary now!'),(90011055,90011056,0,101,0,'Welcome to the Apothecary community! This is a big community and we have 9 phases for the advancement of Apothecaries. Work hard in the future and when you are ready to get promoted, I`m always here for you.'),(90011056,90011057,0,101,0,''),(90011057,610110,0,102,0,'Thank~you. 0'),(90011021,90011022,0,101