 You can level up your sub-class by gaining study points.'),(90014502,90014503,0,102,0,'How~can~I~get~study~points? 90014510'),(90014503,610087,0,102,0,'I~see. 0'),(90014510,90014511,0,101,0,'Well, the only way to get those points is to read the sub-class books, such as the Diligence Book. When you`ve gained enough study points, open the sub-class sheet from the character panel and'),(90014511,90014512,0,101,0,'~level up the sub-class there. Monsters in the wild are always bothering young adventurers, so you might find some books from them.'),(90014512,90014513,0,101,0,''),(90014513,610087,0,102,0,'I~see.~Thanks. 0'),(90014110,90014120,90014130,1551,0,'4 < 1'),(90014120,90014121,0,101,0,'Well, you need to join us before getting promoted. Do you want to become a Sage now?'),(90014121,90014122,0,101,0,''),(90014122,90014123,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join~it. 90014010'),(90014123,610087,0,102,0,'Oh,~I`m~not~ready~yet. 0'),(90014010,90014011,0,101,0,'Want to be a Sage? We`re able to reduce a target`s Magical Defense. Make sure you`ve reached Level 70, and pay 20 Lucky Amulets or 800 Study Points to join us!'),(90014011,90014012,0,101,0,'~After being one of us, you can work on your sub-class training on the `Status` sheet. Remember, a certain sub-class level is required to promote the phase of your sub-class.'),(90014012,90014013,0,101,0,''),(90014013,90014014,0,101,0,''),(90014014,90118260,0,102,0,'Pay~20~Lucky~Amulets~to~join. 90014020'),(90118260,90014015,0,102,0,'Pay~800~Study~Points~to~join. 90118330'),(90014015,610087,0,102,0,'Oh,~it~does~not~suit~me. 0'),(90118330,90118331,0,101,0,'    Are you sure you want to pay 800 Study Points to join us?'),(90118331,90118332,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`ve~decided! 90118261'),(90118332,610087,0,102,0,'No,~I~changed~my~mind. 0'),(90118261,90118262,90014021,1552,0,'4 < 1'),(90118262,90118263,90118264,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 1'),(90118263,90014032,90118264,1001,0,'level < 70'),(90014032,90014033,0,101,0,'You will be invited to join us after