-class sheet from the character panel and'),(90015511,90015512,0,101,0,'~level up the sub-class there. Monsters in the wild are always bothering young adventurers, so you might find some books from them.'),(90015512,90015513,0,101,0,''),(90015513,610079,0,102,0,'Okay. 0'),(90015110,90015120,90015130,1551,0,'3 < 1'),(90015120,90015121,0,101,0,'You are not a Chi Master yet and can`t get promoted. Do you want to join the Chi Master sub-class now?'),(90015121,90015122,0,101,0,''),(90015122,90015123,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join. 90015010'),(90015123,610079,0,102,0,'Oh.~Not~now. 0'),(90015010,90015011,0,101,0,'The Chi Master focuses on immunity rate to critical strikes from enemies. If you`ve reached Level 70 and you want to join us, give me 800 Study Points or a Yin-Yang Fruit'),(90015011,90015012,0,101,0,'~that you can buy from the Horse Race Manager at 10,000 Horse Racing Points. After that, you can start your study of the sub-class on the `Status` sheet.'),(90015012,90015013,0,101,0,'~Remember, a certain sub-class level is required to promote the phase of your sub-class.'),(90015013,90015014,0,101,0,''),(90015014,90118250,0,102,0,'Pay~a~Yin-Yang~Fruit~to~join. 90015020'),(90118250,90015015,0,102,0,'Pay~800~Study~Points~to~join. 90118320'),(90015015,610079,0,102,0,'Oh,~it~does~not~suit~me. 0'),(90118320,90118321,0,101,0,'    Are you sure you want to pay 800 Study Points to join us?'),(90118321,90118322,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`ve~decided! 90118251'),(90118322,610079,0,102,0,'No,~I~changed~my~mind. 0'),(90118251,90118252,90015021,1552,0,'3 < 1'),(90118252,90118253,90118254,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 1'),(90118253,90015032,90118254,1001,0,'level < 70'),(90015032,90015033,0,101,0,'You will be invited to join us after you reach level 70. Work harder!'),(90015033,90015034,0,101,0,''),(90015034,610079,0,102,0,'Oh. 0'),(90118254,90118257,90118255,1001,0,'cultivation < 800'),(90118257,90118258,0,101,0,'You don`t have 800 Study Points to take the sub-class.'),(90118258,610079,0,102,0,'A