it~me. 0'),(97298740,97298741,0,101,0,'<tip color=0xffffff00 desc=		Born with the ability to communicate with animals, he had ever been treated as an alien.'),(97298741,90028000,0,101,0,'Fortunately, his gift was discovered by the Sub-Class Manager.>Wrangler</tip>:\n'),(90028000,90028001,0,101,0,'Hey, there! Let me tell you about the joys of the Wrangler! Wranglers are able to equip special armor on their mounts. As their Sub-Class level improves,'),(90028001,90028002,0,101,0,'~their Max HP increases. Isn`t it great? Would you like to join us?'),(90028002,90028003,0,101,0,''),(90028003,90028004,0,101,0,''),(90028004,90028005,0,101,0,''),(90028005,90028006,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join. 90028010'),(90028006,90028007,0,102,0,'I`d~like~to~get~promoted. 90028110'),(90028007,90028008,0,102,0,'How~can~I~get~promoted? 90028600'),(90028008,610230,0,102,0,'Not~my~concern. 0'),(610230,610011,0,104,0,'10 10 233'),(90028600,90028601,0,101,0,'Each Sub-Class has 9 Phases. The higher the phase is, the more bonus effects you will get.'),(90028601,90028602,0,101,0,'~But keep in mind that these Sub-Classes also have a level system, and you need to level them up before you can get promoted. You can level up your Sub-Class by gaining Study Points.'),(90028602,90028603,0,102,0,'How~can~I~get~Study~Points? 90028610'),(90028603,610230,0,102,0,'I~see. 0'),(90028610,90028611,0,101,0,'Well, the only way to get those points is to read the Sub-Class books, such as the Diligence Book. When you`ve gained enough Study Points,'),(90028611,90028612,0,101,0,'~open the Sub-Class sheet from the character panel and level up the Sub-Class, there. Monsters in the wild are always bothering young adventurers,'),(90028612,90028613,0,101,0,'~so you might find some books after you kill them.'),(90028613,90028614,0,101,0,''),(90028614,610230,0,102,0,'Got~it. 0'),(90028110,90028120,90028130,1551,0,'9 < 1'),(90028120,90028121,0,101,0,'You`re not a Wrangler yet, and can`t get promoted. Would you like to become a Wrangler?'),(90028121,90028122,0,101,0,''),(90028122,90028123,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`d~like~to~join. 90028010'),(90028123,610230,0,102,0,'Not~now. 0'),(90028010,90028011,0,101,0,'Wranglers are able to equip special armor on their mounts. If you`ve reached Level 40, you can pay 40 Saddles or 800 Study Points to join us.'),(90028011,90028012,0,101,0,'~After being a Wrangler, you can enhance your sub-class skill on `Status` sheet. Remember, a certain sub-class level is required to promote the phase of your sub-class.'),(90028012,90028013,0,101,0,''),(90028013,90118310,0,102,0,'Pay~40~Saddles~to~join. 90028020'),(90118310,90028014,0,102,0,'Pay~800~Study~Points~to~join. 90118380'),(90028014,610230,0,102,0,'I~see. 0'),(90118380,90118381,0,101,0,'    Are you sure you want to pay 800 Study Points to join us?'),(90118381,90118382,0,102,0,'Yes,~I`ve~decided! 90118311'),(90118382,610230,0,102,0,'No,~I~changed~my~mind. 0'),(90118311,90118312,90028021,1552,0,'9 < 1'),(90118312,90118313,90118314,1001,0,'metempsychosis < 1'),(90118313,90028032,90118314,1001,0,'level < 70'),(90028032,90028033,0,101,0,'I`m sorry, but you have to reach at least Level 70 to join our fine group of adventurers.'),(90028033,90028034,0,101,0,''),(90028034,610230,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(90118314,90118317,90118315,1001,0,'cultivation < 800'),(90118317,90118318,0,101,0,'You don`t have 800 Study Points to take the sub-class.'),(90118318,610230,0,102,0,'Alright. 0'),(90118315,90118316,0,1001,0,'cultivation += -800'),(90118316,90028051,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 340,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000116,3,0,0'),(90028051,90028052,0,1550,0,'9'),(90028052,90028053,0,1085,0,'gmlog/action_log 340,%user_name[%user_id][%user_lev][%user_pro],0,0,0,0,10000376,1,0,0'),(90028053,90028054,0,1027,0,'self zf2-e300 add'),(90028054,90028055,0,1010,2005,'%s has joined up with the Wranglers!'),(90028055,90028056,0,101,0,'Each Sub-Class has 9 phases. If you want to get promoted one day, you`ll come talk to me.'),(